From 4369627594657c807f91bc36dbcff823843d107c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sagi Shahar <sagis@google.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Jun 2024 01:34:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 72/86] KVM: selftests: TDX: Add TDX MMIO reads test

The test verifies MMIO reads of various sizes from the host to the guest.

Co-developed-by: Isaku Yamahata <isaku.yamahata@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Isaku Yamahata <isaku.yamahata@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Sagi Shahar <sagis@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Ackerley Tng <ackerleytng@google.com>
