---
- Yan: rebased to tdx_kvm_dev-2024-06-21

- Reinette: Squash fix from Binbin to fix the array member from which
  the error code can be obtained. No attribution for small change.

- Reinette: Squash fix from Isaku to add shared bit to MMIO address.
  TDG.VP.VMCALL<MMIO> requires MMIO address to have shared bit and TDVF
  and TD guest Linux does so.  Make selftest conform to it.
  GHCI spec
  TDG.VP.VMCALL<#VE.RequestMMIO>
  The VMM may emulate MMIO space in shared-GPA space.
  Add attribution.

- Reinette: Remove "Change-Id:" tag.

- Reinette: address checkpatch.pl "Macro argument reuse 'VCPU' - possible
  side-effects?" for TDX_TEST_ASSERT_MMIO() by turning it into a function
  tdx_test_assert_mmio().

- Reinette: checkpatch.pl fixes: don't use multiple blank lines,
  alignment should match open parenthesis, 'Varifies' may be misspelled.

- Reinette: remove kerneldoc '/**' marker from comments that do not follow
  kerneldoc syntax

- Reinette: switch to reverse fir where practical
---
 .../selftests/kvm/include/x86/tdx/tdcall.h    |  2 +
 .../selftests/kvm/include/x86/tdx/tdx.h       |  4 +
